      "id": 1,
      "text": "In 1702, a Miami group settled at Atihipi‑Catouy near what is now Fish Lake after the Beaver Wars.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        10,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
