      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Chicago’s ice company harvested ice from Upper and Lower Fish Lake each winter until 1930, once shipping 18 railroad cars of ice daily to the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
